Description: offline MiniOS documentation viewer
 Native GTK 3 application for browsing the MiniOS documentation installed on
 the local system. It provides section navigation, local full-text search,
 language selection and history, and renders precompiled documentation with
 native GTK widgets without WebKit or network access.
